/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 51 0 R
/E (Enhancing the radial velocity precision of high-resolution near-infrared spectrographs for detecting exoplanets around ultracool dwarfs, at the IAA-CSIC. Improvement of the CARMENES-NIR channel thermal stability. Development of a method for computing the projected rotational velocity of the CARMENES stellar sample. Estimation of rotational periods using photometric data \(from TESS, OSN, ...\). Participated in the SPECULOOS-3 b discovery. Design and implementation of opto-mechanical components for the OSN and CAHA observatories.)
